{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"django-flask-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Django and Flask Snippets","description":"Models, views, URLs, serializers and Flask routes.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"Python","path":"snippets/python.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/python.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Django model\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dmodel\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name}(models.Model):\",\n      \"\\t${2:title} = models.CharField(max_length=${3:200})\",\n      \"\\tcreated_at = models.DateTimeField(auto_now_add=True)\",\n      \"\",\n      \"\\tdef __str__(self):\",\n      \"\\t\\treturn self.${2:title}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Django model\"\n  },\n  \"Django view\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dview\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"def ${1:name}(request):\",\n      \"\\treturn render(request, \\\"${2:template.html}\\\", {$0})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function view\"\n  },\n  \"Django class view\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcbv\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name}View(${2:ListView}):\",\n      \"\\tmodel = ${3:Model}\",\n      \"\\ttemplate_name = \\\"${4:template.html}\\\"\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class based view\"\n  },\n  \"Django URL\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"durl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"path(\\\"${1:route}/\\\", views.${2:view}, name=\\\"${3:name}\\\"),\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A URL pattern\"\n  },\n  \"DRF serializer\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"drf\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name}Serializer(serializers.ModelSerializer):\",\n      \"\\tclass Meta:\",\n      \"\\t\\tmodel = ${2:Model}\",\n      \"\\t\\tfields = \\\"__all__\\\"\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A serializer\"\n  },\n  \"Flask app\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"flask\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"from flask import Flask, jsonify\",\n      \"\",\n      \"app = Flask(__name__)\",\n      \"\",\n      \"\",\n      \"@app.get(\\\"/\\\")\",\n      \"def index():\",\n      \"\\treturn jsonify(ok=True)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A minimal Flask app\"\n  },\n  \"Flask route\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"froute\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@app.${1:get}(\\\"${2:/path}\\\")\",\n      \"def ${3:handler}():\",\n      \"\\t$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Flask route\"\n  },\n  \"FastAPI route\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fapi\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@app.${1:get}(\\\"${2:/path}\\\")\",\n      \"async def ${3:handler}():\",\n      \"\\t$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A FastAPI route\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Django and Flask Snippets\n\nModels, views, URLs, serializers and Flask routes.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 8 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Python | `dmodel` | A Django model |\n| Python | `dview` | A function view |\n| Python | `dcbv` | A class based view |\n| Python | `durl` | A URL pattern |\n| Python | `drf` | A serializer |\n| Python | `flask` | A minimal Flask app |\n| Python | `froute` | A Flask route |\n| Python | `fapi` | A FastAPI route |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}